cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its code, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "PRC Platform Dataset 1.4.0"
version: "1.4.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Kochetkov
    given-names: Dmitry
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7890-7532"
    affiliation: "Centre for Science and Technology Studies (CWTS), Leiden University"
license:
    - CC-BY-4.0
    - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/essentia2020/prc-platform-dataset"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible dataset of research works flowing through
  Publish-Review-Curate (PRC) platforms. Platforms are classified on two
  independent axes (who initiates the evaluation; workflow configuration) and
  described by a register of evidence fields. Counts are derived from the
  Crossref REST API and Sciety docmaps and are organised as observation
  series per register row and year.
keywords:
  - publish-review-curate
  - preprint review
  - open peer review
  - scholarly communication
  - Crossref
  - Sciety
